    "sections": {
        "description": "Significo is a fast, clean business theme with a homepage you build from sections in the Customizer: hero, services, about, how it works, testimonials, latest posts, questions, contact and a call to action. Around 200 Customizer options shape the header, top bar, title bar, menus, footer, blog, pages, sidebars, colors and fonts with live preview, and block patterns give About, Services and Contact pages the same look. Six font families ship with the theme and load from your own site. WooCommerce is styled, and the theme works with the block editor and with Elementor."
    },
